# CVE-2026-75595: netty-handler SNI/mTLS bypass, bundled via base image solr:10.0.0-slim.
# Not yet triaged by Solr upstream (solr.apache.org/security-dependency-cves.html).
# Not exploitable here: Solr's Netty usage is SolrJ's internal HTTP/2 client, not an
# SNI-routing mTLS gateway; ingress TLS is terminated by Azure Container Apps, not this JVM.
# Revisit when Solr ships a stable tag with netty-handler >=4.1.137.Final/4.2.17.Final.
CVE-2026-75595
